        "wild": "Cryolophosaurus glacialis is an extremely aggressive theropod adapted to cold environments. It can spit a torpor-inducing liquid at range or exhale a freezing blast of cold air. When it enters an excited state — triggered by its freeze breath — its speed, damage, and resistance all increase dramatically, making it especially terrifying in sustained combat.",
